{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/extras/IMG_0904.png?t=1749617686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The home of the slimes is in danger\u2026 and you are their last hope.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime Match Adventure is a Match-3 Puzzle Roguelite where every match fuels your magic. Combine slimes to gain mana, cast spells, and survive a series of tactical battles across a branching combat map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s in this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a sneak peek at the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 6 out of 12 unique power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f 1 Boss Fight with original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcab Limited access to the spellcasting, map progression, and match-3 combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20 Passive upgrades via Wishing Nodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version offers <strong>a complete mini-run experience</strong> from start to boss. You can replay to try different strategies, power-ups, and builds \u2014 just like in the full game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/extras/SMA_Gif.gif?t=1749617686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Curious what comes next?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you\u2019ll face:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ power-ups with new tactical combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple zones with unique visuals and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New elite enemies and boss encounters</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794080?t=1749617686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3794080?t=1749617686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/c635cdb40eec0a2f2adeb7c264e74666e45a75bf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749617686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/c635cdb40eec0a2f2adeb7c264e74666e45a75bf/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749617686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/extras/IMG_0904.png?t=1749617686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The home of the slimes is in danger\u2026 and you are their last hope.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slime Match Adventure is a Match-3 Puzzle Roguelite where every match fuels your magic. Combine slimes to gain mana, cast spells, and survive a series of tactical battles across a branching combat map.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What\u2019s in this demo?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo gives you a sneak peek at the full game:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd13 6 out of 12 unique power-ups</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2694\ufe0f 1 Boss Fight with original music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcab Limited access to the spellcasting, map progression, and match-3 combat system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf20 Passive upgrades via Wishing Nodes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This version offers <strong>a complete mini-run experience</strong> from start to boss. You can replay to try different strategies, power-ups, and builds \u2014 just like in the full game.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/extras/SMA_Gif.gif?t=1749617686\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Curious what comes next?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the full version, you\u2019ll face:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">12+ power-ups with new tactical combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiple zones with unique visuals and mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New elite enemies and boss encounters</p></li></ul>","developers":["SlothSoft Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3732840","name":"Slime Match Adventure"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3794080/93411fdb8dbde7415e919feb5232d275698ad56d/header.jpg?t=1749617686","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> SteamOS 3.0 / Linux (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-1215U o equivalente<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Mesa drivers / Vulkan compatible GPU (e.g., AMD APU, Intel UHD)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257150589,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150589/movie480.mp4?t=1749151945","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150589/movie_max.mp4?t=1749151945"},"name":"Slime Match Adventure Trailer 01","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257150589/33a980d1bd4354059c0c9ea05d3d7011f6fd02a6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749151945","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257150589/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1749151945","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_traile